      "sourceText": "1. 没有任务时，`io.run()` 立刻返回。\n2. `post()` 可以把普通函数投递给 `io_context` 执行。\n3. `work_guard` 可以防止 `io.run()` 因为没任务而退出。\n4. `std::bind` 可以绑定普通函数，也可以绑定成员函数。\n5. `boost::asio::buffer()` 通常只是内存视图，不负责延长数据生命周期。\n6. 异步工程里最重要的是对象生命周期和 buffer 生命周期。",
      "translatedText": "1. When there are no tasks,`io.run()` return immediately\\.\n2. `post()` Ordinary functions can be submitted to `io_context` for execution\\.\n3. `work_guard` Can prevent `io.run()` from exiting because there are no tasks\\.\n4. `std::bind` Can bind ordinary functions, and can also bind member functions\\.\n5. `boost::asio::buffer()` Usually just a memory view, not responsible for extending the data lifetime\\.\n6. In asynchronous engineering, the most important things are object lifetime and buffer lifetime\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
